 "remarks": "A private estate where timeless architecture meets resort-inspired living. Set on a professionally landscaped property in one of Stamford's most desirable locations, this exceptional custom residence offers more than 7,000 sq ft of refined living space designed for elegant entertaining and luxurious everyday living. A dramatic 2-story foyer opens to soaring ceilings, rich hardwood floors, 3 fireplaces, gracious formal rooms, a sun-filled family room, private executive office, and a spectacular chef's kitchen featuring premium appliances, an oversized island, walk-in pantry, and spacious casual dining area. The magnificent primary suite is a true retreat, complete with a boutique-inspired dressing room with illuminated glass cabinetry and center island, beverage station, and a spa-quality marble bath with soaking tub, oversized rain shower, and designer finishes. Spacious secondary bedrooms provide beautifully appointed accommodations for family and guests. The finished lower level offers exceptional flexibility with recreation and wellness spaces, a sauna, and a private in-law suite with its own kitchen, living room, bedroom, bath, laundry, and separate entrance - ideal for extended family, guests, or live-in staff. Surrounded by peaceful wooded privacy yet just minutes from downtown Stamford, Metro-North, the Merritt Pkwy, and only an hour from Manhattan, this extraordinary residence delivers an unmatched blend of luxury, craftsmanship, privacy, and convenience.",
